  - .sdd/projects/vkard.az/stack/{layer}.sdd

Outputs:
  - {output file path 1}
  - {output file path 2}

Validation:
  - {validation criterion 1}
  - {validation criterion 2}

Decision:
  - DEC-000

Created_At: <timestamp>
Updated_At: <timestamp>


State: +

